   <Row ss:StyleID="hdr"><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Name</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">الاسم</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kind</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sector | القطاع</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Country | الدولة</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">City | المدينة</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Region</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Email | البريد</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Email 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Phone | الهاتف</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Phone 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">WhatsApp</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Address | العنوان</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Website | الموقع</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">LinkedIn</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Social</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Profile | نبذة</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Size</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Completeness %</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Gaps | النواقص</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Source method</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Enrichment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Source URLs</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Confidence</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Verification</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">State</Data></Cell></Row>
   <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Baker Hughes Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">بيكر هيوز العراق</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas Services</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">mysupporthr@bakerhughes.com</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">corporatesecretary@bakerhughes.com</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">+17134896711</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">road suite of solutions provide greater efficiency and availability across LNG operations</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.bakerhughes.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/bakerhughes/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/bakerhughes/ | https://twitter.com/bakerhughesco | https://www.instagram.com/bakerhughesco | https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxhgTNB0eD0xUeeJnP9Ow4g</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Baker Hughes provides integrated oilfield services, technology, and equipment to Iraq's oil and gas industry, with operations supporting upstream projects in both the south and north. The company offers drilling services, artificial lift, and measurement-while-drilling solutions. Baker Hughes works alongside major IOCs and Iraqi national companies.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">100</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">web-scrape</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">enriched</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.bakerhughes.com/contact-us | https://www.bakerhughes.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.95</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Genel Energy</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">جينيل إنرجي</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Erbil</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kurdistan Region of Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">info@genelenergy.com</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">sustainability@genelenergy.com</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">+4403713842893</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">+4402076595100</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Street St Helier Jersey JE2 3RA Sustainability Philip Johnson ESG Manager +44 (0)20 7659 5100 su</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://genelenergy.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/genel-energy-plc/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/genel-energy-plc/ | https://www.instagram.com/genelenergyplc</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Genel Energy is a London-listed independent oil and gas company with primary assets in the Kurdistan Region of Iraq, including production-sharing interests at Taq Taq and Tawke fields. The company has operated in Iraqi Kurdistan since the early 2000s under contracts with the Kurdistan Regional Government. Genel remains one of the leading independent operators active in the KRI upstream sector.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">medium</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">100</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">web-scrape</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">enriched</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://genelenergy.com/contact-us/ | https://genelenergy.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.91</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">BP Iraq (Rumaila Operating Organisation)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">بي بي العراق - منظمة تشغيل الرميلة</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">roopresscentre@rumaila.iq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">rumailapresscentre@roobasra.com</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://rumaila.iq/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">linkedin.com/company/rumaila-operating-organisation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.facebook.com/rumaila.iq.en/ | https://www.instagram.com/rumaila_operating_organisation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">BP operates in Iraq primarily through the Rumaila Operating Organisation (ROO), a joint venture with Basra Oil Company and CNPC to develop the Rumaila super-giant field, one of the world's largest oil fields. BP holds a 38% technical service contractor interest and has been active on the field since 2009. Rumaila produces well over one million barrels per day.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">phone address</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">web-scrape</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">enriched</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://rumaila.iq/ | https://rumaila.iq/english/serving-iraq/supporting-enterprise/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.96</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">TotalEnergies Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">توتال إنيرجيز العراق</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">+330147444546</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://totalenergies.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/totalenergies/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/totalenergies/ | https://twitter.com/TotalEnergies | https://www.facebook.com/TotalEnergies/ | https://www.instagram.com/totalenergies | https://www.youtube.com/TotalEnergies</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">TotalEnergies holds interests in the Halfaya field in Missan Governorate and signed a landmark integrated energy deal with the Iraqi government in 2021 covering Artawi field development, solar power generation, seawater treatment, and gas capture across Basra. The French major is one of the largest foreign investors in Iraq's current energy transition projects. TotalEnergies' Iraq portfolio spans both upstream oil and clean energy infrastructure.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email address</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">web-scrape</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">enriched</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://totalenergies.com/contact-form | https://totalenergies.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.95</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SLB Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">إس إل بي العراق</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas Services</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">building a more inclusive workplace, and driving positive socioeconomic outcomes</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.slb.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/slbglobal/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/slbglobal/ | https://www.facebook.com/WeAreSLBGlobal | https://www.instagram.com/slb_global | https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCzX5PhHCet4oAi_iTutUo5Q</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SLB (formerly Schlumberger) operates extensively across Iraq's major oilfields, providing drilling, reservoir characterization, and production services. The company has a significant presence in southern Iraq's prolific Basra region and works with both national and international operators. SLB is among the largest oilfield services providers active in Iraq.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">web-scrape</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">enriched</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.slb.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.97</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lukoil Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">لوك أويل العراق</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">st. Widgets LUKOIL overview LUKOIL is one of the largest oil &amp; gas vertical integrated compan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://lukoil.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">linkedin.com/company/lukoil</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lukoil, Russia's largest privately-owned oil company, holds the operator stake in the West Qurna-2 field in southern Iraq, one of the world's largest undeveloped oil accumulations. Lukoil signed its service contract with Iraq's Ministry of Oil in 2009 and commenced production in 2014. The company serves as technical service contractor alongside Iraqi state partners.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">web-scrape</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">enriched</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://lukoil.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.95</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Weatherford International Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ويذرفورد الدولية العراق</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas Services</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Building wells that last a lifetime Learn more VERO OneTouch Automated Tubular System Traditional</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.weatherford.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/weatherford/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/weatherford/ | https://x.com/WeatherfordCorp | https://www.facebook.com/WeatherfordCorp | https://www.instagram.com/weatherfordcorp | https://www.youtube.com/user/weatherfordcorp</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Weatherford International provides drilling, well evaluation, and production services in Iraq, supporting IOC-operated and national company projects across multiple governorates. The company supplies well construction, artificial lift, and completion equipment solutions. Weatherford has maintained a continuous operational base in Iraq to serve the country's expanding upstream sector.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">web-scrape</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">enriched</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.weatherford.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.88</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Halliburton Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">هاليبرتون العراق</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas Services</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.halliburton.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/halliburton</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.linkedin.com/company/halliburton | https://www.facebook.com/halliburton | https://www.instagram.com/halliburton | https://www.youtube.com/iframe_api</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Halliburton has maintained operations in Iraq since the post-2003 period, offering well completion, cementing, stimulation, and drilling services to operators across Iraqi oilfields. The company supports major upstream projects in Basra and other producing regions. Halliburton is one of the three largest oilfield services companies active in the country.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone address</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">web-scrape</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">enriched</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://www.halliburton.com/</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.96</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq National Oil Company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">شركة النفط الوطنية العراقية</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Baghdad</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Baghdad Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://inoc.com.iq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">linkedin.com/company/iraq-national-oil-company-inoc</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq National Oil Company (INOC) is the state-owned holding entity re-established in 2018 to oversee Iraq's oil and gas sector and coordinate the regional operating companies. INOC manages Iraq's hydrocarbon policy and acts as the umbrella above Basra Oil Company, North Oil Company, and other subsidiaries. It is the apex institution of Iraq's upstream petroleum industry.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone address</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">model-knowledge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unreachable</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.65</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CNPC Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">المجموعة الوطنية الصينية للنفط في العراق</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Baghdad</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Baghdad Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://cnpc.com.cn</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">linkedin.com/company/cnpc</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">China National Petroleum Corporation (CNPC) is one of the most active international oil companies in Iraq, holding stakes in Rumaila (38%), Halfaya (37.5%), Missan fields cluster, and Ahdab. CNPC's engagement in Iraq dates to the 1990s and expanded substantially after 2009 under technical service contracts. The company is widely regarded as Iraq's largest foreign upstream investor by barrels managed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone address</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">model-knowledge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unreachable</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.93</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra Oil Company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">شركة نفط البصرة</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://basraoil.com.iq</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Basra Oil Company (BOC) was established to replace the South Oil Company and manages production from the supergiant Rumaila, West Qurna 1, West Qurna 2, Majnoon, and Zubair fields. It is among the world's highest-volume oil producers and operates in partnership with BP, Lukoil, Shell, and ExxonMobil. BOC is the single most important entity in Iraq's oil export infrastructure.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone address linkedin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">model-knowledge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unreachable</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">North Oil Company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">شركة نفط الشمال</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kirkuk</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kirkuk Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://northoilco.com.iq</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">North Oil Company (NOC) manages hydrocarbon extraction in northern Iraq, primarily the historic Kirkuk oil field whose production dates to the 1930s. Established in 1972 after nationalization of the Iraq Petroleum Company, NOC has been a cornerstone of Iraq's oil industry for decades. The company operates in disputed territories straddling Arab and Kurdish regions.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">large</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone address linkedin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">model-knowledge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unreachable</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Missan Oil Company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">شركة نفط ميسان</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Amarah</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Missan Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://missanoil.com.iq</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Missan Oil Company is a state-owned Iraqi enterprise responsible for the Missan oil fields cluster in southeastern Iraq, including Buzurgan, Abu Ghirab, and Fauqi fields. The company partnered with CNPC and CNOOC under a technical service contract signed in 2009. Missan's fields have seen significant capacity growth through Chinese investment and technology transfer.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">medium</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone address linkedin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">model-knowledge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unreachable</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Midland Oil Company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">شركة نفط الوسط</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Baghdad</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Baghdad Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://midlandoil.com.iq</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Midland Oil Company (MOC) is an Iraqi state oil company overseeing central Iraq fields including the Ahdab field developed under contract with CNPC. The company manages assets in Wasit Governorate and surrounding areas and reports directly to Iraq's Ministry of Oil. MOC plays a key role in unlocking Iraq's central-region reserves.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">medium</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone address linkedin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">model-knowledge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unreachable</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dhi Qar Oil Company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">شركة نفط ذي قار</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">company</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oil &amp; Gas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Iraq</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nasiriyah</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dhi Qar Governorate</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">https://dhiqaroil.com.iq</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dhi Qar Oil Company manages oil production in Dhi Qar governorate in southern Iraq, including the Nasiriyah field and surrounding blocks. The company is state-owned and operates under the Iraqi Ministry of Oil. Development of the Nasiriyah block has attracted sustained international interest given its significant proven reserves.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">medium</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">email phone address linkedin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">model-knowledge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unreachable</Data></Cell><Cell/><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">0.45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">unverified</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">new</Data></Cell></Row>
  </Table>
